{"title":"Aug 1 — East Jeju","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 1 — East Jeju"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Saturday · August 1, 2026 · Day 7 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">East Jeju 🌅</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Seongsan · Haenyeo Show · Gwangchigi Beach · Umu & Gamttanam · Jeju</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug01\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug01').setView([33.4600, 126.9000], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Shilla Stay Jeju Airport', lat:33.48580289503151, lng:126.49091012883574, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Jeju+Airport' },\n    { name:'Seongsan Ilchulbong (Sunrise Peak) 🌅', lat:33.4583, lng:126.9422, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seongsan+Ilchulbong+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Haenyeo Diver Show 🤿', lat:33.464604859978465, lng:126.93627516215088, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rnbz4s2sdFUvYDZG6' },\n    { name:'Jong Ga Abalone Restaurant 🐚', lat:33.532, lng:126.851, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jong+Ga+Abalone+Restaurant+Jeju+Gujwa' },\n    { name:'Gwangchigi Beach 🏖️', lat:33.4650, lng:126.9200, c:'#1976D2', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gwangchigi+Beach+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Jeju Island Brewery 🍺', lat:33.38512556225428, lng:126.79389390674648, c:'#F57F17', url:'https://maps.app.goo.gl/DNonGxdLKWSbXRs48' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" style=\"border-color:#F9A825;background:#FFFDE7\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T07:00\" data-lat=\"33.48580289503151\" data-lng=\"126.49091012883574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">07:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">🍳 Breakfast</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Breakfast Buffet · Cafe (12F) · Shilla Stay Jeju Airport</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\"><strong>Weekend hours: 07:00–10:00</strong> (Weekdays: 06:30–09:30) · Buffet breakfast on the 12th floor. Breakfast is included for the entire stay.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T09:00\" data-lat=\"33.4583\" data-lng=\"126.9422\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🥾 Morning Hike</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Hike Seongsan Ilchulbong (Sunrise Peak)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">UNESCO World Heritage volcanic crater rising from the sea. Stunning panoramic views from the summit crater rim.<br><br>\n      🚗 <strong>~55 min drive</strong> from Shilla Stay Jeju Airport. Tickets ₩2,000. Hike up takes 20–30 min (can be steep). Bring water and sunscreen — exposed trail in summer heat.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seongsan+Ilchulbong+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Seongsan Peak</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/성산일출봉\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Midday</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T11:30\" data-lat=\"33.532\" data-lng=\"126.851\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">11:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🐚 Lunch</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Jong Ga Abalone Restaurant (종가전복)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">🕐 <strong>Closes at 4:00 PM</strong> — go right after the hike while it's open.<br>Fresh Jeju abalone on the north coast of Gujwa-eup. Haemajihaean-ro coastal road, right near Myeongjin Jeonbok. Known for abalone porridge (전복죽) and grilled abalone (전복구이).</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jong+Ga+Abalone+Restaurant+Jeju+Gujwa\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/종가전복+구좌읍\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card activity\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T13:30\" data-lat=\"33.464604859978465\" data-lng=\"126.93627516215088\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🤿 Show</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Haenyeo Diver Show</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Watch Jeju's legendary female free-divers (해녀) demonstrate their tradition of diving without equipment to harvest abalone, sea urchin, and seaweed. A living piece of UNESCO Intangible Heritage.<br><br>\n      🕑 <strong>Show starts at 2:00 PM daily — closed Mondays.</strong><br>\n      ⚠️ Arrive early to secure a good viewing spot as it fills up quickly.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rnbz4s2sdFUvYDZG6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해녀공연+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Beach & Cafe</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T15:00\" data-lat=\"33.4650\" data-lng=\"126.9200\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">15:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🏖️ Beach</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Gwangchigi Beach</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Scenic east-coast beach with black lava rocks and Seongsan Ilchulbong as a backdrop. Great for swimming or just relaxing.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gwangchigi+Beach+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gwangchigi Beach</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/광치기해변\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T16:00\" data-lat=\"33.38512556225428\" data-lng=\"126.79389390674648\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🍺 Brewery</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Jeju Island Brewery</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">🕐 <strong>10:30–17:00 · Closed Sundays</strong><br>Craft brewery on the east side of Jeju — a natural stop on the drive west from Gwangchigi Beach. Try their Jeju-inspired craft beers before heading to dinner.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/DNonGxdLKWSbXRs48\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주+아일랜드+브루어리\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T19:30\" data-lat=\"33.48580289503151\" data-lng=\"126.49091012883574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag tbd\">FREE NIGHT</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍽️ Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Free Night — Explore Near Hotel</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">After a big day in East Jeju, wind down near the Shilla Stay area. Options:\n      <ul>\n        <li>Seafood restaurants along Jeju port</li>\n        <li>Dongmun Market for street food and snacks</li>\n        <li>Jeju-style galchi (hairtail fish) near the hotel</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=restaurants+near+Shilla+Stay+Jeju+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find Dinner</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주공항+근처+맛집\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Breakfast included</strong> at Shilla Stay Jeju Airport (12F Cafe) — weekday 06:30–09:30, weekend 07:00–10:00. Today is Saturday so buffet runs until 10:00. Drive to Seongsan is ~55 min.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Saturday · August 1, 2026 · Day 7 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">East Jeju 🌅</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Seongsan · Haenyeo Show · G