n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rnbz4s2sdFUvYDZG6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해녀공연+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Beach & Cafe</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T15:00\" data-lat=\"33.4650\" data-lng=\"126.9200\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">15:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🏖️ Beach</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Gwangchigi Beach</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Scenic east-coast beach with black lava rocks and Seongsan Ilchulbong as a backdrop. Great for swimming or just relaxing.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gwangchigi+Beach+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gwangchigi Beach</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/광치기해변\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T16:00\" data-lat=\"33.38512556225428\" data-lng=\"126.79389390674648\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🍺 Brewery</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Jeju Island Brewery</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">🕐 <strong>10:30–17:00 · Closed Sundays</strong><br>Craft brewery on the east side of Jeju — a natural stop on the drive west from Gwangchigi Beach. Try their Jeju-inspired craft beers before heading to dinner.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/DNonGxdLKWSbXRs48\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주+아일랜드+브루어리\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T19:30\" data-lat=\"33.48580289503151\" data-lng=\"126.49091012883574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag tbd\">FREE NIGHT</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍽️ Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Free Night — Explore Near Hotel</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">After a big day in East Jeju, wind down near the Shilla Stay area. Options:\n      <ul>\n        <li>Seafood restaurants along Jeju port</li>\n        <li>Dongmun Market for street food and snacks</li>\n        <li>Jeju-style galchi (hairtail fish) near the hotel</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=restaurants+near+Shilla+Stay+Jeju+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find Dinner</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주공항+근처+맛집\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Breakfast included</strong> at Shilla Stay Jeju Airport (12F Cafe) — weekday 06:30–09:30, weekend 07:00–10:00. Today is Saturday so buffet runs until 10:00. Drive to Seongsan is ~55 min.</div>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-so